# Hero video.
#
# A1.mp4 is 584MB and A3.mp4 is 493MB — both far past GitHub's 100MB hard
# limit per file, so they cannot be committed to a normal repository at all.
# The hero degrades correctly without them: PhotoField layers the video over
# the still and only reveals it once it can play, so with no file present the
# photograph simply stays. Drop the mp4s back into public/img/ locally and the
# motion returns with no code change.
public/img/*.mp4
